WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.640
Ayoomp.

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:05.700
Thanks for your hard work, Tachiaoi.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.060
Sure, same goes for you two.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.950
<i>Lately I've been worried about something.</i>

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:14.000
<i>Am I really cut out to be Team Rat's leader?</i>

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.420
Tachiaoi!

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:19.660
Let's see...

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:21.750
Well, what will do we today?

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.610
I wanna go catch food!

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:26.710
Food, huh? And you, Hagi?

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.460
That's fine by me.

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:31.720
Okay, we'll go search for—

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.550
Cool! Let's catch another wild boar!

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:35.980
Even bigger than the one the other day!

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:37.590
No, Higuruma, that's...

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.530
A boar's out of the question.

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:43.480
We got the last one because 
it was caught in a trap,

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.520
but we haven't set any today.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:48.280
No worries! We can do it without a trap.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:50.070
Forget about it.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:55.200
If we get into a fight with a boar, 
we'll get bitten, charged at, and trampled.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.700
We'll wind up dead.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:01.270
You think too negatively, Hagi.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:04.120
If it charges at you, just dodge.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:06.610
You're not serious enough, Higuruma.

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.730
For food, let's be safe and pick fruit.

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.380
Aww, but don't you want to eat meat?

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.090
Not if I'm dead.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:16.550
What do we do, Tachiaoi?

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:21.970
U-Um...

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:56.440
<b>A Team Leader's Troubles</b>

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:55.610
Yahoo!

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:05.850
What do we do, Tachiaoi?

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.830
U-Um...

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:10.780
Let's see...

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:16.260
We'll set a boar trap, 
then safely gather fruit.

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:18.280
If a rabbit or something 
shows up, we'll catch it!

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:19.730
What do you think...?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.310
Okay, that works.

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:24.140
That's fine by me.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:25.880
Okay, let's head out!

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:29.100
Be safe and look around first, Higuruma.

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:34.100
<i>I'm not very leader-like.</i>

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:38.070
<i>All I ever do is tweak </i>their<i> ideas.</i>

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:42.290
<i>I've got to truly lead this 
team, for their sake, as well.</i>

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:44.120
<i>But how do I do it?</i>

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:45.530
Hey! Hey!

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:48.240
Want to take a shortcut?

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.220
Shortcut?

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:53.080
If we climb this cliff, it's right there.

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:55.080
H-Huh?!

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:59.940
It's dangerous. Look how 
rocky it is. We'll die!

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:04.520
Let's just take the path below instead.

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:07.080
But that'll take a long time.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.140
And it could rain if we don't hurry.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:12.350
But slow and steady wins the race.

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:15.610
If it starts raining, we 
could slip and get hurt,

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.600
and it'll be too cold to get up.

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:22.510
Nobody will find us, winter will 
set in, and we'll freeze to death.

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:26.160
We'll be fine if we climb up before all that!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:29.160
We won't be fine. This is a foolish plan.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.370
What do we do, Tachiaoi?

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:39.390
W-Well, we could sort of run 
quickly along the lower path.

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:40.450
How's that sound?

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.440
Okay, we'll do that.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:45.080
Hagi, let's race!

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:47.690
But there's a tripping hazard.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:51.430
Hey, Nee-sama!

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:53.770
What are we doing this afternoon?

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.260
I want to take it easy!

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:59.520
I want to fish! Let's catch dinner!

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:01.510
Then we'll kick back while fishing.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:02.480
That's the ticket!

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:03.960
What'll we fish for?

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:06.490
Big ones, of course.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:08.460
I'll land the biggest!

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:09.440
None of that!

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:10.120
Huh?

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.240
Today is teamwork training.

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:14.180
Aww!

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:17.220
It's for overcoming your weak points.

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:18.560
What do we say?

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.000
Yes, ma'am...

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:23.790
Even though they're perfectly 
in tune at times like this.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:24.840
Yeah, really.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.490
Come on, let's go.

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:29.470
Don't leave me behind, Nee-sama!

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:29.470
Tsubaki-chan!

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:33.420
<i>Wow! That's so... leader-like!</i>

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.570
<i>If I were to lead the team like that...</i>

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:38.190
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:40.240
Tachiaoi?

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.520
What's up?

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:44.390
Change of plans.

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:44.990
Huh?

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:49.110
We're going to do shuriken practice!

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:53.910
I-It's to overcome our weak points!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.440
I'm not bad at using shuriken.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:59.270
Was it a weak point of yours, Tachiaoi?

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:01.880
A-Anyway, we're doing it!

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.780
Sure, okay.

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:04.760
Got it!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:09.000
Okay, then, run to the training ground!

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:11.180
Yay!

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:12.100
Uh, hey, Tachiaoi...

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.790
Follow me!

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:29.060
There. Now, let's begin!

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:32.140
H-Hold on, Tachiaoi!

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:34.800
Wh-Where are the shuriken?

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:35.540
Huh?

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:37.920
We didn't bring any.

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:39.750
That's true, come to think of it!

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:43.310
I tried to tell you, but you took off.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:47.530
Well, what can you do? 
Might as well go catch a boar!

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:49.250
I told you, it won't work.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.250
Jutsu.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.890
We're going to practice Jutsu!

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:54.880
Okay.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.180
F-Fine.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.500
Which Jutsu?

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:01.560
U-Um, whichever ones we're each bad at.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.900
Oh, a rabbit.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.680
Hey, meat! Let's catch it!

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:10.490
We'll just get tired if 
we blindly chase after it.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.540
Look, it hasn't noticed us!

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:15.120
It'll run off, once we get close.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.690
Don't get distracted!

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:19.540
Fire Style.

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:22.880
We'll practice Fire Style!

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.630
Ow! Hot!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.960
Shouldn't you just blow harder?

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:34.740
Like this.

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:38.560
You're blowing too hard! 
I'll get burned to death!

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:40.480
<i>I wonder if I'm a good leader now.</i>

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.480
But any less than this doesn't look cool.

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:43.140
<i>Are they going to follow along?</i>

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.410
<i>I'm not so sure!</i>

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:48.400
Ow!

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.820
I'm beat!

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.960
Hey, Tachiaoi.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:59.760
Isn't it about time?

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:02.570
Sure, we'll take a break after a bit.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:06.840
Th-That's not what I mean.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.810
Um, we might be too late.

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:12.890
I mean, any second now... it'll rain.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:16.600
It's raining, all right!

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:18.840
Feels good to wash away the sweat.

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:20.930
I-I'll catch a cold and die.

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:24.930
<i>I forgot it would rain.</i>

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:35.710
It's too wet to work.

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:36.810
What about Fire Style?

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:37.970
I'm all out.

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:39.200
Me, too.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.840
<i>What a mess.</i>

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:46.860
<i>I forget the shuriken,</i>

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:49.180
<i>I leave them both exhausted,</i>

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:50.890
<i>I forget about the rain...</i>

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:56.470
<i>The only place I'm leading 
them is around in circles.</i>

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:02.740
<i>I'm not fit to be a leader.</i>

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:08.730
Tachiaoi.

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:12.420
Uh, you two... I...

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:13.900
We're sorry.

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:19.480
We're always saying opposite things,

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:22.520
and we wondered if you're tired of it.

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:23.120
And so...

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.060
...we're sorry!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:30.340
I'll try to be a little more positive.

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:33.840
And I'll try to think more 
carefully about things.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:37.180
Because we want you to be cheerful!

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:38.300
Right?

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.030
Yeah.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:46.580
T-Tachiaoi?

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:51.190
Oh.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:55.150
So, that's why you've 
seemed kind of odd today.

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:56.860
I'm really sorry.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:00.370
Not only did I cause trouble, 
I also made you worry.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.880
Yeah, you did!

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:04.460
You're fairly clumsy, Tachiaoi.

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:06.920
I'm sorry...

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.880
Hey, Tachiaoi.

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:13.830
If you've been troubled, 
be sure and say something.

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:16.210
After all, I might be able to help.

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:19.680
I want to support you, too.

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:23.140
It's okay, Tachiaoi.

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:27.230
Because we think of you as a leader!

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:28.440
Right?

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:29.170
Yeah.

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.750
Don't cry, Tachiaoi!

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:37.600
If too many tears come out, 
you'll wind up dead.

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:54.130
It was a passing shower.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:58.720
Rain is a good thing!

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.570
I don't like getting wet.

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:02.180
What do we do now?

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:05.210
It's still a little early to go home.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.810
We might catch colds from getting wet.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.140
And it's too late for the 
rain to wash off the sweat.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:12.850
A bath!

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:14.640
Okay!

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:17.070
<i>I have to do more than just imitate others.</i>

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:21.200
<i>I must find my own way of doing this.</i>

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:27.490
<i>For the sake of these two, 
I'll try harder from now on.</i>

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:30.870
Yahoo!

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.000
That's hot!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.710
You're not supposed to leap in.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:40.330
We're cold, so your heart'll 
stop, and you'll die.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:43.140
Isn't it better to warm up quickly?

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:46.240
No, it's not. You need to do it slowly.

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:48.560
You'll just get cold while
you're pouring on hot water.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:51.000
You'll get lightheaded 
if you swim in the bath.

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:52.600
Oh, it's fine!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.120
No, it's not.

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:56.170
You think too much, Hagi.

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.020
That's not true.

00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:58.020
<i>I'll keep at it.</i>

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:02.450
<b>Favors and Debts</b>

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:01.990
Hey! Mizu-senpai!

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:04.650
You started reading a book again!

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:07.620
Sorry. This one was so nostalgic, I had to...

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:10.480
Just please keep working.

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:12.370
And you, too, Beni-senpai.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:14.960
We need to quickly finish tidying 
up, and get to training.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:15.740
Nope.

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:16.390
Huh?

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:17.840
Forget about training.

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:20.050
It could rain at any minute.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:22.640
We can't train like this, can we?

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:24.430
Oh, no!

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:26.010
She's right.

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:28.680
You'd best stay indoors the rest of the day.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.020
Mokuren-san.

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:32.140
It looks like it will be a heavy rain.

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:33.930
I see.

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:35.770
Save your outside tasks for tomor—

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.230
Sh-She vanished?!

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.480
Was that Rindou-san's Come Here Jutsu?!

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:42.660
Huh?

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:44.400
Rindou?!

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:46.450
Mokuren! Emergency!

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.740
Nee-sama is...! Nee-sama is...

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.960
sick with a cold!

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:53.890
A cold, huh?

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:56.600
Sazanka carried on so much, 
I panicked and summoned you.

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:58.290
But this is serious!

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.660
Sorry this is so sudden.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:03.470
No, don't worry about it.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.240
Cure her with your "whap" thing! "Whap"!

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:08.180
That doesn't work on colds.

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:10.880
And I just ran out of medicine.

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:13.840
Though I could make some right away 
if I had the herbal ingredients.

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:14.680
Medicinal herbs?

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:17.560
You just need those, right? I'll go get them!

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:19.390
What kind? Where are they?

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:20.570
I'll go get them real quick.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:22.190
No, you won't!

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:24.000
Why not, Nee-sama?!

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:26.100
The weather is getting worse.

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:29.800
I can't have you exposed 
to danger on my account.

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:32.600
No! I won't listen to you 
this time! I'm going!

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:34.250
Sazanka!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:36.680
What you're talking about sounds fun.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:37.750
Benisumomo.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:43.340
I wouldn't mind gathering those herbs, 
and having Tsubaki owe me one.

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:44.160
Wha?!

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.890
What kind of herbs are they?

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:48.160
They have notched leaves, like this.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:50.680
They grow in the Mountain Center Cave.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:51.380
Got it.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:52.690
H-Hey!

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:55.210
Well, whoever gets there first wins.

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:56.760
It'll be me, though.

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:58.380
Asagao!

00:13:58.380 --> 00:13:59.100
Agreed!

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:01.650
Let's go!

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:05.400
<b>Team
Dog</b>

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:03.850
Away they go.

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:11.990
We have to gather the herbs and 
get back before Benisumomo!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:12.700
Of course!

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:16.080
I don't want to end up owing her anything!

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.210
She's too fast, you know!

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:25.210
Just you wait!

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.510
<b>Mountain Center</b>

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:34.730
We caught up.

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:36.640
I just stopped, that's all.

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:38.430
Why, to give yourself a handicap?

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:40.820
Wrong. Take a look.

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:45.230
Oh! The cave entrance!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.630
It collapsed...

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:48.320
What're you staring for?

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:49.700
Start digging.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:50.280
Huh?!

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.720
What, dig here?!

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:54.560
Oh? Are you going to give up and leave?

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:56.750
Team Dog isn't much to bark about.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.010
Say what?!

00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.100
Asagao!

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:01.440
It's for Nee-sama's sake.

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:04.380
You had better help, too!

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:06.340
Of course I will.

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:10.680
The truth is, I'd rather not, 
but I want to get back before it rains.

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:14.810
Getting Tsubaki in my debt sure isn't easy.

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:19.790
I'm the one who'll help Nee-sama!

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:23.480
Sazanka!

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:24.700
That's pointless.

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:26.570
Why you!

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:34.030
You kids think you can beat me? 
Keep dreaming.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:38.360
If you've got enough spare energy 
for that, use it for digging.

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:50.970
Yes! The entrance!

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:53.730
We just need to keep digging like this!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.930
What're you doing?!

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:00.320
Looks like it's all right inside.

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:01.180
Huh?

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:02.690
We don't have time to widen it.

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:03.130
Eh?

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:04.270
Sazanka.

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:06.970
You should be able to fit. Get in there.

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:08.780
As if I need you to tell me!

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:12.230
Wait, Sazanka! She's sure to snatch it away.

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:14.520
Even so, I still have to go!

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:16.930
We need to hurry and get it to Nee-sama.

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:36.090
Sazanka!

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:38.650
Welcome back! Do you have the herbs?

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:41.060
Oh! You did it!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:44.670
Benisumomo, fight a duel with me.

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:45.400
Huh?

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.570
Whoever wins gets to deliver 
the herbs to Nee-sama.

00:16:48.910 --> 00:16:49.970
Well?

00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:51.260
Sazanka...

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:53.200
Even when you have no chance?

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.240
I know that! But still!

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:59.740
Giving up and handing them over is different 
from fighting and having them taken!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:03.790
I won't let you take away 
Team Dog's pride, as well!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:06.950
That's right!

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:10.400
I'll fight you, too! 
Don't mess around with Team Dog!

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:15.120
Could you come on any stronger?

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:19.720
I won't take it. You two go deliver it.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:20.880
Huh?

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:23.240
It doesn't seem to matter anymore.

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:25.880
Now that I've seen you trying so hard.

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:27.440
Wh-What's this, all of a sudden?

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:30.150
I don't dislike that sort of thing.

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:35.540
I thought of you as kids, 
but you're Team Dog to the core.

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:39.070
Let's hurry and get it to Tsubaki.

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:56.590
Thank goodness!

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:57.360
Yeah.

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:59.310
She has an unexpected good side.

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:01.510
She does.

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:02.810
No need to hang around.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:05.140
Let's go home.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:07.080
Yeah!

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.850
Wait... Huh?!

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.370
Hey, what is this?!

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:14.570
A kunoichi needs to be 
harder to trick than <i>this</i>.

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:17.150
Now you've learned something.

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:23.830
<b>Mountain Center</b>

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:21.360
This is too cruel, you know!

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:23.830
Come on, it's time we left.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.950
Sazanka, at this rate...

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:32.710
Forget about it.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:35.920
Even the two of us together 
are no match for Benisumomo.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:38.680
We've lost this time.

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:47.520
It's raining harder now.

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:48.960
We're back.

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:50.320
Welcome ho—

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.690
And now, you owe me one.

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:02.080
Sorry, Tsubaki-chan. We lost.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:04.410
"Lost," you say?

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:10.040
Sazanka?

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:14.460
Sure, if what's in the bag is 
the real deal! But too bad!

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:17.380
The real stuff's right here!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:22.430
You've been tricked, Benisumomo! 
The bag you held holds nothing but weeds!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.760
Oh, it's true.

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:25.470
Oh! Which means...

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:26.220
That's right.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:29.850
Major upset for the win!

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:33.300
Praise me, please, Nee-sama!

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:35.290
You're going to catch my cold.

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:36.610
Mokuren, do the honors.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:38.490
Sure, I'll make it right away.

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.570
Nee-sama! Rub, rub, rub!

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:40.570
Benisumomo.

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:42.530
I'm in your debt.

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:44.990
Don't know what you're talking about.

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:48.450
<b>Team
Sheep</b>

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:48.450
But hey, I'll take what I can get.

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:50.130
See ya.

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:52.620
Huh?

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.660
Wh-Wh-What was that all about, Nee-sama?

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:56.630
I thought we won!

00:19:57.100 --> 00:20:00.810
Benisumomo was never trying 
to compete with you.

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:05.260
You two were hellbent on going, 
so she escorted you.

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:07.810
Beni-senpai!

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:09.930
<b>Akane
Class</b>

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:13.020
<b>Sheep</b>

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:13.020
Where have you been in all this rain, 
neglecting your cleaning duties?

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:13.020
<b>Akane
Class</b>

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:17.580
Babysitting, and enjoying it.

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:18.820
Huh?!

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:21.700
Then what was that whole scramble 
for the medicinal herbs?!

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:23.980
Probably a pretext for going with you.

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:28.440
You mean, in other words, 
she had us fooled the whole time?

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:33.370
Well, it's a fact that she escorted you, 
so let's thank her properly next time.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.640
Not on your life!

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:41.760
She totally used us for fun, you know!

00:22:19.200 --> 00:22:20.260
Mokuren.

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:22.480
Oh, Benisumomo!

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:25.300
This is unusual, seeing you out here!

00:22:28.140 --> 00:22:30.060
You seem more cheerful than usual.

00:22:30.060 --> 00:22:32.130
Oh, can you tell?

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:34.560
Something happened that made me very happy!

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:35.580
Like what?

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:40.580
Believe it or not, Tsuwabuki and Housenka 
helped me look for medicinal herbs!

00:22:41.510 --> 00:22:43.340
Isn't that ordinary?

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:44.960
It's your team's job, right?

00:22:44.960 --> 00:22:49.400
You've got it wrong. Those two 
always fight, and then take off.

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:51.970
But today they helped me, 
and they didn't fight!

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:54.280
They're not here.

00:22:54.280 --> 00:22:56.030
They were until earlier.

00:22:56.030 --> 00:22:59.770
But Housenka made Tsuwabuki mad,

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:02.690
and then Tsuwabuki chased after her.

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:04.490
And now they're gone.

00:23:05.340 --> 00:23:07.660
And you're okay with that?

00:23:07.660 --> 00:23:10.320
Shouldn't you tell them 
off every now and then?

00:23:10.770 --> 00:23:13.240
Be stern! You're their leader!

00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:18.180
You're right.

00:23:19.470 --> 00:23:21.500
Fighting's not a good thing.

00:23:22.610 --> 00:23:24.450
That wasn't my point.

00:23:28.060 --> 00:23:29.980
Which herbs are you looking for?

00:23:29.980 --> 00:23:30.520
Huh?

00:23:30.520 --> 00:23:32.310
I'll use this basket.

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:34.150
You're going to help?

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:36.500
I'm so glad, Benisumomo!

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next time:

00:23:38.300 --> 00:23:39.660
To be continued!
